 the source evaluator, AnalysisView is the contradiction detector, EntitiesView is the network mapper, PerspectivesView is the domain expert. Make these roles explicit: each view could have a persona with preferences.\",\"reasoning\":\"The views implicitly model different analyst roles but this is not leveraged. Explicit personas could guide UX (what would a source evaluator want to see first?), enable role-based report generation, and create a mental model for users to understand what each view offers.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:25:21.556Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:25:21.556Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
[2026-01-30T00:25:31.330Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01LJgui8NLyUADBaJCoySqkL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Report Views - Insight Synth Complete ✓\n\n**Scan ID:** `02dd88f0-62e6-4f07-9cf3-05e45d81612b`\n\n**5 Ideas Created:**\n\n1. **Views Are Facets Of A Single Data Crystal** - All six views render SessionWithDetails from different angles using duplicated useMemo patterns. Create a DataFacet abstraction where views declare what data they need declaratively, centralizing derivation and enabling caching.\n\n2. **View Mode Is A Cross-Cutting Concern** - OverviewView (video/static), SourcesView (cards/network/radar), EntitiesView (constellation/cards) all implement view mode toggles independently. Create a ViewModeContext for global mode preferences and cross-view synchronization.\n\n3. **Selection Is A Global Focus System** - expandedId, selectedSource, selectedEntity are all the same concept: user focus. Create a ReportFocusContext with focus history and cross-view broadcasting - selecting a source should highlight related findings in FindingsView.\n\n4. **Visualizations Are Views That Know Graph Theory** - SourceNetwork, EntityConstellation, CausalFlow, ContradictionMatrix are all graph visualizations with different strategies. Create a unified GraphVisualization primitive accepting nodes/edges and a rendering strategy.\n\n5. **Each View Is An Intelligence Analyst Role** - OverviewView=executive, FindingsView=evidence analyst, SourcesView=source evaluator, etc. Make these roles explicit to guide UX decisions and create mental models for users.\n\n**Key Observation:** The views are more interconnected than their isolated implementation suggests. Three cross-cutting concerns (data faceting, view modes, focus/selection) are being managed independently per-view when they should be coordinated globally. Unifying these would transform the report from six disconnected pa